entries[201558] = { ["name"] = "Fishbrul Special", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nDrogbar-Style Salmon , Cursed Queenfish (5), Mossgill Perch (5), Black Barracuda (5), Stonedark Snail (10), Dalapeño Pepper (5)\nYou don't waste a single ingredient, preparing much more Fishbrul Special in each batch.\nZone:\nDalaran\nNPC:\nNomi\nDiscovery:\nNomi's Test Kitchen\n\n(10)\nUse: Restores 28846 health and 14423 mana over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating.\n\nIf you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain a chance while attacking to unleash a volley of Pepper Breath fireballs, each dealing 174 Fire damage. This bonus lasts 1 hour.\n40" }
